Air pollution stands as one of the most urgent environmental and public health challenges facing modern urban centers1. This issue is primarily driven by rapid industrialization, increasing vehicular traffic2, and changing climatic conditions3,4. Fine particulate matter (PM\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
